Subject: [PATCH 05/12] feat(desktop): add initial v3 data hooks and resource
 loader

Introduce generic useResource hook returning 4-state results
(loading, empty, ready, error with reload). Implement useProjects,
useProject, useRuns, and useRun with four-state unit tests.
